<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Meeting Confirmation - Stable Partners</title>
    <style>
        body { 
            margin: 0; 
            padding: 0; 
            background-color: #F8FAFC; 
            font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            color: #1E293B;
            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
        }
        .wrapper {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 40px 20px;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 500px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 16px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 15px -3px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }
        .header {
            background-color: #1800AC;
            padding: 32px 40px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .logo {
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 800;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.3em;
            color: #ffffff;
        }
        .content {
            padding: 40px;
        }
        .content h1 {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 800;
            line-height: 1.2;
            margin: 0 0 24px 0;
            color: #0F172A;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .content p {
            font-size: 15px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin: 0 0 24px 0;
            color: #475569;
        }
        .info-card {
            background-color: #F8FAFC;
            border: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 24px;
            margin-bottom: 32px;
        }
        .label {
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.05em;
            color: #94A3B8;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
            display: block;
        }
        .value {
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #1E293B;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }
        .value:last-child {
            margin-bottom: 0;
        }
        .button {
            display: block;
            background-color: #1800AC;
            color: #ffffff !important;
            padding: 16px 24px;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 14px;
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 32px;
        }
        .footer {
            padding: 24px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 11px;
            color: #94A3B8;
            background-color: #F8FAFC;
            border-top: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="wrapper">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="header" style="background-color: #ffffff; padding: 20px; text-align: center; border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9;">
                <img src="https://stablepartners.com/stable-patners-logo.jpg" alt="Stable Partners" style="height: 50px; width: auto;">
            </div>
            
            <div class="content">
                <h1>Session Confirmed</h1>
                <p>Hello <%= locals.name %>,</p>
                <p>Your strategy session with Stable Partners Group has been officially scheduled. We look forward to discussing your portfolio performance.</p>
                
                <div class="info-card">
                    <span class="label">Date & Time</span>
                    <div class="value"><%= locals.date %></div>
                    
                    <span class="label">Meeting Link</span>
                    <div class="value" style="word-break: break-all; color: #1800AC;"><%= locals.link %></div>
                </div>

                <a href="<%= locals.link %>" class="button">Join Google Meet</a>

                <p style="margin-top: 32px; font-size: 13px; text-align: center;">
                    Please ensure you are in a quiet environment with a stable connection.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="footer">
                &copy; 2026 Stable Partners Group. All rights reserved.
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
